          {
            "id": "INV-GAS-CAP-001",
            "text": "MAX_TRANSACTION_GAS_LIMIT = 2^24 = 16,777,216. This constant is fixed at the protocol level and does not change with block gas limit adjustments."
          },
          {
            "id": "INV-GAS-CAP-002",
            "text": "The transaction gas cap is strictly independent of the block gas limit. The block gas limit may exceed 16,777,216, but no single transaction within that block may have a gasLimit exceeding 16,777,216."
